**************************************************************
Column
1st------ Z-Target (Atomic Number)
2nd------ Target-Initial-Number of electron
3rd------ Target n-state of the captured electron
4th------ Target-Initial state number (from sclit.**)
5th------ Target-Final state number (from sclit.**)
6th------ Z-Beam (Atomic Number)
7th------ Beam-Initital-Number of electron
8th------ Beam n-state of the captured electron
9th------ Beam-Initial state number (from sclit.**)
10th----- Beam-Final state number (from sclit.**)
11th----- Cross-section data [eV v/s 1e-16 cm^2] (should be stored in /atomic_data/CX/data/)
